  ('MB-J0', 'REFAL compares jurisdictions neutrally and does not present a universal winner. Country-specific claims must use current approved evidence and be qualified to the client''s circumstances; the agent should ask which business, ownership, residence, and operating factors matter before offering a comparison.', array['jurisdiction-dubai', 'jurisdiction-estonia', 'jurisdiction-malta-bulgaria', 'jurisdiction-usa']::text[], 'mb-manual', 'newplan/Master Brain & Operating Rules Manual - REFAL AI.txt', 'MB 3.3 / SOURCE-ANALYSIS 7.4', 'GLOBAL', '[]'::jsonb, 'STABLE', 'explanatory', false, 'BOSS', '2026-10-07'::date, null, '2027-10-07'::date, 365, array['ar', 'en', 'el']::text[], 'pending', 'Internal comparison posture, not evidence for Cyprus market access, substance, banking, residency, tax, or investment outcomes. Route specific claims through approved current sources and specialist review where needed.'),   -- MB-J0
  ('MB-J1', 'The UAE government states that it does not levy personal income tax. This does not establish an individual''s tax position in other countries or determine whether a UAE or Cyprus company is suitable.', array['jurisdiction-dubai']::text[], 'foreign-authority', 'newplan/Master Brain & Operating Rules Manual - REFAL AI.txt', 'https://u.ae/en/information-and-services/finance-and-investment/taxation', 'AE', '[]'::jsonb, 'VOLATILE', 'regulated', false, 'BOSS', '2026-10-07'::date, null, '2026-11-06'::date, 30, array['ar', 'en', 'el']::text[], 'pending', 'Narrow statement supported by the UAE government taxation page; individual and cross-border tax treatment requires case-specific advice.'),   -- MB-J1
  ('MB-J2', 'Estonian e-Residency is a digital identity and does not grant physical residence. Estonia generally taxes company profits when distributed, subject to applicable exceptions and cross-border tax rules.', array['jurisdiction-estonia']::text[], 'foreign-authority', 'newplan/Master Brain & Operating Rules Manual - REFAL AI.txt', 'https://learn.e-resident.gov.ee/hc/en-gb/articles/360000711978-What-is-e-Residency; https://www.e-resident.gov.ee/et/taxes-in-estonia/', 'EE', '[]'::jsonb, 'VOLATILE', 'regulated', false, 'BOSS', '2026-10-07'::date, null, '2026-11-06'::date, 30, array['ar', 'en', 'el']::text[], 'pending', 'Limited to the Estonian e-Residency and tax explanations cited in the public fact source audit; treatment depends on current law and the specific facts.'),   -- MB-J2
  ('MB-J3', 'The cited Bulgarian government source states a 10% corporate tax rate. Malta''s corporate tax rate is 35%, and eligible shareholders may claim refunds under its tax refund system, subject to applicable conditions.', array['jurisdiction-malta-bulgaria']::text[], 'foreign-authority', 'newplan/Master Brain & Operating Rules Manual - REFAL AI.txt', 'https://www.mi.government.bg/en/general/deklarirane-i-izplashtane-na-korporativen-danak-godishna-dan/; https://cfr.gov.mt/en/inlandrevenue/corporatetax/Pages/Corporate-Tax.aspx', 'EU', '[{"value":"10%","kind":"rate"},{"value":"35%","kind":"rate"}]'::jsonb, 'VOLATILE', 'regulated', false, 'BOSS', '2026-10-07'::date, null, '2026-11-06'::date, 30, array['ar', 'en', 'el']::text[], 'pending', 'Narrowly states the Bulgarian headline rate and Malta''s refund system from the respective official sources; no comparative banking, language, cost, or Cyprus claims.'),   -- MB-J3
  ('MB-J4', 'U.S. LLC federal tax classification generally depends on the number of members and elections made with the IRS. Foreign owners may also have U.S. tax obligations where income is effectively connected with a U.S. trade or business; classification and filing depend on the facts.', array['jurisdiction-usa']::text[], 'foreign-authority', 'newplan/Master Brain & Operating Rules Manual - REFAL AI.txt', 'https://www.irs.gov/businesses/small-businesses-self-employed/limited-liability-company-llc; https://www.irs.gov/individuals/international-taxpayers/effectively-connected-income-eci', 'US', '[]'::jsonb, 'VOLATILE', 'explanatory', false, 'BOSS', '2026-10-07'::date, null, '2026-11-06'::date, 30, array['ar', 'en', 'el']::text[], 'pending', 'Scoped to IRS LLC classification and effectively connected income guidance; obtain case-specific U.S. tax advice for entity classification, income sourcing, and filing obligations.'),   -- MB-J4
  ('MB-DYN1', 'Available properties, unit prices, technical details and current availability are read live from the property database for the specific request and are never stated from memory.', '{}'::text[], 'refalco-commercial', 'newplan/Master Brain & Operating Rules Manual - REFAL AI.txt', 'MB 5.3 / SOURCE-ANALYSIS 9.4', 'CY', '[]'::jsonb, 'VOLATILE', 'commercial', false, 'BOSS', '2026-10-07'::date, null, '2026-11-06'::date, 30, array['ar', 'en', 'el']::text[], 'pending', 'No owning topic, so volatility and tier are set here: it governs live commercial inventory.'),   -- MB-DYN1
  ('MB-DYN2', 'The reservation deposit amount and conditions are read live from the property database for the specific project and are never stated from memory.', '{}'::text[], 'refalco-commercial', 'newplan/Master Brain & Operating Rules Manual - REFAL AI.txt', 'MB 5.3 / SOURCE-ANALYSIS 9.4', 'CY', '[]'::jsonb, 'VOLATILE', 'commercial', false, 'BOSS', '2026-10-07'::date, null, '2026-11-06'::date, 30, array['ar', 'en', 'el']::text[], 'pending', 'No owning topic. Pairs with MB-F50, which is the customer facing form of the same prohibition.'),   -- MB-DYN2
  ('MB-DYN3', 'Annual renewal costs for secretary, registered address, accounting, audit and taxes are read live from the corporate pricing source when the customer asks about annual costs, and are never stated from memory.', '{}'::text[], 'refalco-commercial', 'newplan/Master Brain & Operating Rules Manual - REFAL AI.txt', 'MB 5.3 / SOURCE-ANALYSIS 9.4', 'CY', '[]'::jsonb, 'VOLATILE', 'commercial', false, 'BOSS', '2026-10-07'::date, null, '2026-11-06'::date, 30, array['ar', 'en', 'el']::text[], 'pending', 'No owning topic, so volatility and tier are set here: it governs a published price list.'),   -- MB-DYN3
  ('MB-DYN4', 'Available appointment slots and consultant schedules by timezone are read live from the calendar integration when moving to booking, and are never stated from memory.', '{}'::text[], 'mb-manual', 'newplan/Master Brain & Operating Rules Manual - REFAL AI.txt', 'MB 5.3 / SOURCE-ANALYSIS 9.4', 'GLOBAL', '[]'::jsonb, 'VOLATILE', 'explanatory', false, 'BOSS', '2026-10-07'::date, null, '2026-11-06'::date, 30, array['ar', 'en', 'el']::text[], 'pending', 'No owning topic. An operational scheduling rule with no commercial or legal figure behind it.'),   -- MB-DYN4
  ('MB-DYN5', 'Government fees, land registry fees and residency application fees are read live from the regulatory rates source when a total deal cost is computed, and are never stated from memory.', '{}'::text[], 'cy-authority', 'newplan/Master Brain & Operating Rules Manual - REFAL AI.txt', 'MB 5.3 / SOURCE-ANALYSIS 9.4', 'CY', '[]'::jsonb, 'VOLATILE', 'regulated', false, 'BOSS', '2026-10-07'::date, null, '2026-11-06'::date, 30, array['ar', 'en', 'el']::text[], 'pending', 'No owning topic. These are authority set fees, so the tier is regulated.'),   -- MB-DYN5
